From: =?UTF-8?q?Mikkel=20Inumineq=20J=C3=B8rgensen?=
 <6770514+inumineq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:33:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] arm64: dts: qcom: instantnoodlep: Enable SLPI
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Use the device-specific joined SLPI firmware supplied from the owner OTA.
The existing SM8250 GLINK edge provides the non-secure SDSP FastRPC
channel and compute context banks.

Signed-off-by: Mikkel Inumineq Jørgensen <6770514+inumineq@users.noreply.github.com>
Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-oneplus-instantnoodlep.dts | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-oneplus-instantnoodlep.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-oneplus-instantnoodlep.dts
index 0d14a19ff..55cbe4ed3 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-oneplus-instantnoodlep.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-oneplus-instantnoodlep.dts
@@ -542,3 +542,8 @@ &usb_1_qmpphy {
 	vdda-pll-supply = <&vreg_l18a_0p92>;
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+&slpi {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sm8250/OnePlus/instantnoodlep/slpi.mbn";
+	status = "okay";
+};
